"text": "2"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-2"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and let your tent curtains be stretched out; ( C )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( C )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-2"
],
"id": null,
"text": "do not hold back;"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-2"
],
"id": null,
"text": "lengthen your ropes,"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-2"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and drive your pegs deep."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-3"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18727",
"text": "3 For you will spread out to the right and to the left, ( D "
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "3"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( D )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-3"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and your descendants will dispossess nations"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-3"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and inhabit the desolate cities."
},
{
"tag": "div",
"class": [
"poetry",
"top-1"
],
"id": null,
"text": "4 “Do not be afraid, for you will not be put to shame; ( E )"
},
{
"tag": "p",
"class": [
"line"
],
"id": null,
"text": "4 “Do not be afraid, for you will not be put to shame; ( E )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-4"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18728",
"text": "4 “Do not be afraid, for you will not be put to shame; ( E )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "4"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( E )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-4"
],
"id": null,
"text": "don’t be humiliated, for you will not be disgraced."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-4"
],
"id": null,
"text": "For you will forget the shame of your youth,"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-4"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and you will no longer remember"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-4"
],
"id": null,
"text": "the disgrace of your widowhood. ( F )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( F )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-5"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18729",
"text": "5 Indeed, your husband is your Maker ( G ) —"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "5"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( G )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-5"
],
"id": null,
"text": "his name is the Lord of Armies—"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"small-caps",
"divine-name"
],
"id": null,
"text": "Lord"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-5"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and the Holy One of Israel ( H ) is your Redeemer; ( I )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( H )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( I )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-5"
],
"id": null,
"text": "he is called the God of the whole earth."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-6"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18730",
"text": "6 For the Lord has called you,"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "6"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"small-caps",
"divine-name"
],
"id": null,
"text": "Lord"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-6"
],
"id": null,
"text": "like a wife deserted and wounded in spirit, ( J )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( J )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-6"
],
"id": null,
"text": "a wife of one’s youth ( K ) when she is rejected,”"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( K )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-6"
],
"id": null,
"text": "says your God."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-7"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18731",
"text": "7 “I deserted you for a brief moment, ( L )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "7"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( L )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-7"
],
"id": null,
"text": "but I will take you back with abundant compassion."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-8"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18732",
"text": "8 In a surge of anger"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "8"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-8"
],
"id": null,
"text": "I hid my face ( M ) from you for a moment,"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( M )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-8"
],
"id": null,
"text": "but I will have compassion on you"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-8"
],
"id": null,
"text": "with everlasting love,” ( N )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( N )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-8"
],
"id": null,
"text": "says the Lord your Redeemer."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"small-caps",
"divine-name"
],
"id": null,
"text": "Lord"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-9"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18733",
"text": "9 “For this is like the days [ a ] of Noah to me:"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "9"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"footnote"
],
"id": null,
"text": "[ a ]"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-9"
],
"id": null,
"text": "when I swore that the water of Noah"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-9"
],
"id": null,
"text": "would never flood the earth again, ( O )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( O )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-9"
],
"id": null,
"text": "so I have sworn that I will not be angry with you"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-9"
],
"id": null,
"text": "or rebuke you. ( P )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( P )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-10"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18734",
"text": "10 Though the mountains move"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "10"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-10"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and the hills shake,"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-10"
],
"id": null,
"text": "my love will not be removed from you"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-10"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and my covenant of peace ( Q ) will not be shaken,”"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( Q )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-10"
],
"id": null,
"text": "says your compassionate Lord ."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"small-caps",
"divine-name"
],
"id": null,
"text": "Lord"
},
{
"tag": "div",
"class": [
"poetry",
"top-1"
],
"id": null,
