},
{
"tag": "p",
"class": [
"line"
],
"id": null,
"text": "11 “Poor Jerusalem, storm-tossed, and not comforted, I will "
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-11"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18735",
"text": "11 “Poor Jerusalem, storm-tossed, and not comforted,"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "11"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-11"
],
"id": null,
"text": "I will set your stones in black mortar, [ b ]"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"footnote"
],
"id": null,
"text": "[ b ]"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-11"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and lay your foundations in lapis lazuli. ( R )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( R )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-12"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18736",
"text": "12 I will make your fortifications [ c ] out of rubies,"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "12"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"footnote"
],
"id": null,
"text": "[ c ]"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-12"
],
"id": null,
"text": "your gates out of sparkling stones,"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-12"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and all your walls out of precious stones."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-13"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18737",
"text": "13 Then all your children will be taught by the Lord , ( S )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "13"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"small-caps",
"divine-name"
],
"id": null,
"text": "Lord"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( S )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-13"
],
"id": null,
"text": "their prosperity will be great,"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-14"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18738",
"text": "14 and you will be established"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "14"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-14"
],
"id": null,
"text": "on a foundation of righteousness."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-14"
],
"id": null,
"text": "You will be far from oppression,"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-14"
],
"id": null,
"text": "you will certainly not be afraid;"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-14"
],
"id": null,
"text": "you will be far from terror,"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-14"
],
"id": null,
"text": "it will certainly not come near you."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-15"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18739",
"text": "15 If anyone attacks you,"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "15"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-15"
],
"id": null,
"text": "it is not from me;"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-15"
],
"id": null,
"text": "whoever attacks you"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-15"
],
"id": null,
"text": "will fall before you."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-16"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18740",
"text": "16 Look, I have created the craftsman"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "16"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-16"
],
"id": null,
"text": "who blows on the charcoal fire"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-16"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and produces a weapon suitable for its task;"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-16"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and I have created the destroyer to cause havoc."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-17"
],
"id": "en-CSB-18741",
"text": "17 No weapon formed against you will succeed,"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"versenum"
],
"id": null,
"text": "17"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-17"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and you will refute any accusation [ d ]"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"footnote"
],
"id": null,
"text": "[ d ]"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-17"
],
"id": null,
"text": "raised against you in court."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-17"
],
"id": null,
"text": "This is the heritage of the Lord ’s servants, ( T )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"small-caps",
"divine-name"
],
"id": null,
"text": "Lord"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( T )"
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-17"
],
"id": null,
"text": "and their vindication is from me.” ( U )"
},
{
"tag": "sup",
"class": [
"crossreference"
],
"id": null,
"text": "( U )"
},
{
"tag": "p",
"class": [
"right"
],
"id": null,
"text": "This is the Lord ’s declaration."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"text",
"Isa-54-17"
],
"id": null,
"text": "This is the Lord ’s declaration."
},
{
"tag": "span",
"class": [
"small-caps",
"divine-name"
],
"id": null,
"text": "Lord"
},
